<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="story-hero grain">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Our Story</div>
    <h1>Chocolate that tastes<br />like it means it.</h1>
    <p>Made in small batches, by hand, right here in Badaro — no shortcuts, nothing rushed.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap story-flow">
  <div class="story-row reveal">
    <div class="art-lg tone-coral"></div>
    <div class="copy">
      <div class="num">01 — The Beginning</div>
      <h2>A counter, a craving, and a lot of stubbornness.</h2>
      <p>Noir started the way most good things in Badaro do — small, personal, and a little obsessive. Serena wanted a place where chocolate wasn't an afterthought stacked behind a coffee counter, but the whole point.</p>
      <p>What began as a handful of recipes shared with friends became a daily counter of chocodonuts, pralines, and cakes made fresh each morning.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="story-row reverse reveal">
    <div class="art-lg tone-ink"></div>
    <div class="copy">
      <div class="num">02 — The Craft</div>
      <h2>Small batches, every single morning.</h2>
      <p>Nothing at Noir is made ahead and held. Chocolate is tempered, cakes are baked, and fondants are filled the same day they're sold — which means some days, favourites sell out. We're fine with that trade.</p>
      <p>It's slower, and it costs more to run this way. It's also the only way we know how to do it properly.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="story-row reveal">
    <div class="art-lg tone-coral"></div>
    <div class="copy">
      <div class="num">03 — Beyond Chocolate</div>
      <h2>Coffee, cakes, and everything in between.</h2>
      <p>The chocolate came first, but the counter grew — a proper coffee bar, sandwiches for the in-between hours, and cakes built for actual celebrations, not just display cases.</p>
      <p>Same standard throughout: made fresh, made by hand, made in Badaro.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="story-band grain">
  <div class="wrap">
    <blockquote>&ldquo;Everything on our counter is made fresh, never rushed — that's not a slogan, it's just how we run the kitchen.&rdquo;</blockquote>
    <cite>Serena, Founder of Noir</cite>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="wrap">
  <div class="pillars reveal">
    <div class="pillar">
      <div class="n">01</div>
      <h3>Handcrafted</h3>
      <p>Every piece shaped, filled, and finished by hand — no factory lines here.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <div class="n">02</div>
      <h3>Small-Batch</h3>
      <p>Made fresh daily, in quantities we can actually stand behind.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pillar">
      <div class="n">03</div>
      <h3>Beirut, With Love</h3>
      <p>Rooted in Badaro, delivered with care across the city we call home.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="story-cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Taste It Yourself</div>
    <h2>Ready when you are.</h2>
    <p>Browse the full menu and have it delivered, or stop by the counter in Badaro.</p>
    <a href="/shop" class="btn btn--ghost">Explore the Menu</a>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
